 "about": "Spartan Rage. Meter is 0-100. Activation chord is bindings.b_rage. While active the DLL scales damage dealt/taken, regenerates health, speeds animations and tints the screen. gain_scale multiplies every Rage gain (per-move rage_gain and gain_per_pct_hp_lost): 3.0 filled the bar in about 85 s of fighting in 0.1.15 (good for testing); the release pace is 1.25 (0.1.21 at 1.5 was 'still a bit fast', most of it from damage taken, so gain_per_pct_hp_lost went 0.9 -> 0.6). Turning Rage on heals activation_heal_pct of max HP and knocks down everything within burst_radius_m for burst_stagger_s; each kill while raging adds kill_extend_s (up to duration_s).",
